- mental-health board approval;
- clinical efficacy, diagnosis, treatment, or replacement of therapy;
- production launch, adoption, user counts, health outcomes, or exact latency;
- that unfinished agents were launched;
- an unconfirmed regeneration or retry design;
- an `Intern`, `Prompt Engineer`, or `Team Lead` title;
- two separate Think Round jobs;
- any deleted non-AI work from an older canonical.

Reference contact recorded for verification use only, not default resume display: Heidi, heidi@thinkround.org.

